   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "JL 261016: \"I think we need to put them out, like we also have\nthe haipipe-draft and haipipe-display, so it will be natural to\nhave the haipipe-evidence, like we can find the evidence we\nneed, in many other scenarios\";",
   "originalText": "JL 261016: \"I think we need to put them out, like we also have\nthe haipipe-draft and haipipe-display, so it will be natural to\nhave the haipipe-evidence, like we can find the evidence we\nneed, in many other scenarios\";",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
