   "versionNonce": 66,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What is settled so far (261016): two kinds of card by where the\nevidence comes from, CITE (a discovery Task or Job: papers,\nand any value or figure a paper reports;",
